{"id":"ba2db76478a6200d","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-representation-strong.md","title":"Strong Representability","display":"thm-representation-strong — Strong Representability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-representation-strong","aliases":["92-thm-representation-strong"],"display":"thm-representation-strong — Strong Representability","depends_on":["[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-thm-representability]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）","source_status":"原书表示性思想的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-representation-strong"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-representation-strong</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-representation-strong — Strong Representability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b2170bf5b3075ce\" href=\"?note=0b2170bf5b3075ce\" title=\"92-thm-representability\">92-thm-representability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书表示性思想的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (system G and its closed theorem set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec},\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec},\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (decidability and strong numeralwise-representability predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}representation\\text{-}strong}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}representation\\text{-}strong}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>强可表示性：可判定集可被公式&quot;完全决定&quot;</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\)</span>已在<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>中用无捕获代入展开为逐个numeral证明正确的正、负实例；本定理不再复制一份易漂移的公式</li>\n<li>经典理论本来就证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(\\varphi(x)\\lor\\neg\\varphi(x))\">\\(\\forall x(\\varphi(x)\\lor\\neg\\varphi(x))\\)</span>；该排中律不表达集合的可判定性，故从结论中删除</li>\n<li>这是从可判定性到强表示性的定理；反向一般需要可靠性等额外条件，不能称为无条件“双向刻画”</li>\n<li>用于证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>能讨论所有可判定性质</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本条中的旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> 仍表示正负数码定义。强可定义函数另有内部唯一输出条件，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"be5eece035332f0c\" href=\"?note=be5eece035332f0c\" title=\"92-df-strongly-definable-function\">92-df-strongly-definable-function</a>；仅配对图码可定义不能直接省去该条件。原书对角函数强可定义性在 p. 102 的 Proposition 4 明确给出。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）。</p>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-representability","status":"resolved","id":"0b2170bf5b3075ce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-representability]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)$已在[[92-df-representable]]中用无捕获代入展开为逐个numeral证明正确的正、负实例；本定理不再复制一份易漂移的公式","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-strongly-definable-function","status":"resolved","id":"be5eece035332f0c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"本条中的旧 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 仍表示正负数码定义。强可定义函数另有内部唯一输出条件，见[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]]；仅配对图码可定义不能直接省去该条件。原书对角函数强可定义性在 p. 102 的 Proposition 4 明确给出。","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q","status":"resolved","id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"算术强度核对：$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ 表示每条 $Q$ 公理在 $G$ 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]；若继续要求 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 $G$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec},\\mathrm{Rep}_G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}representation\\text{-}strong}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x(\\varphi(x)\\lor\\neg\\varphi(x))","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2278,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-298","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-representation-strong]]"}],"outgoing":["d9d845f6cd765d21","b090f61b9f3ec664","468d35690d25ee42","e0eabee5d77258a7","0b2170bf5b3075ce","975b3aa9a1e08797","be5eece035332f0c","0a1ba58f66cc8d4e"]}